    slug: "polite-payment-reminder-templates",
    title: "7 Polite Payment Reminder Templates You Can Copy",
    excerpt:
      "7 copy-ready WhatsApp templates for chasing invoices politely, from a friendly pre-due-date nudge to a firm final reminder, with amounts in Rp.",
    category: "Business",
